The weights is a list of 1 and 3.
Keep a shared prefix as an empty list of whole numbers.
The running is 0.
For each weight in weights.
Add weight to running.
Place running into prefix.

The seed is 2026.
The picks is 5.
Keep a shared chosen as 0.
Keep a shared limit as 0.
Keep a shared floorat as 0.
Keep a shared ceiling as 0.
Keep a shared probe as 0.
Set limit to the last position of prefix.

To search with aim (a whole number).
Set floorat to 0.
Set ceiling to limit.
Set chosen to 0.
Repeat while floorat is at most ceiling.
Set probe to (floorat plus ceiling) divided by 2.
The here is probe.
If item here of prefix is more than aim, set ceiling to probe minus 1, otherwise set floorat to probe plus 1.
Set chosen to floorat.
If floorat is more than ceiling, stop.

For every draw from 1 to picks.
Set seed to seed times 1103515245 plus 12345.
Set seed to seed modulo 2147483648.
The target is seed modulo running.
Search with target.
Show chosen.

